<article>
<center><h2>Full Recipe: Pav Bhaji</h2></center>

<center><h3>Ingredients</h3>
<p>
4 boiled potatoes,<br>
1 cup mixed vegetables (peas, carrots, capsicum),<br>
2 onions (chopped),<br>
2 tomatoes (chopped),<br>
2 tbsp pav bhaji masala,<br>
Butter,<br>
Salt and chili powder,<br>
Pav (bread rolls)
</p></center>

<center><h3>Instructions</h3>
<p>
1. Heat butter in a pan and sauté onions until golden.<br>
2. Add tomatoes and cook until soft.<br>
3. Add all vegetables and mash them properly.<br>
4. Add pav bhaji masala, salt, and chili powder.<br>
5. Cook for 10–15 minutes while stirring.<br>
6. Toast pav with butter on a pan.<br>
7. Serve hot with chopped onions and lemon.
</p>

</article>

